# Vommet topic branches: work that is not on main yet.
# testing = main + a --no-ff merge of each, in this order.
#
#   <branch>                 based on main
#   <branch> after <parent>  based on another topic (use this when two topics
#                            touch the same lines, so the resolution lives in
#                            the child branch instead of being redone on every
#                            sync; the parent must be listed first)
#   <branch> overlay         based on testing itself: for one change that spans
#                            many topics (e.g. making their strings
#                            translatable). Replayed onto the regenerated
#                            testing and merged last; list overlays after
#                            every regular topic. Its commits are the
#                            single-parent commits above the testing merge it
#                            was built on.
#
# Remove a line when its branch merges into main.
